      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:d5d5b118-6051-4109-9c67-7316481901fd>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40396,
      "native_body_tokens": 180,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 539,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 0,
      "ending_type": "explicit_omission",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "poetic_parody",
        "truncated"
      ],
      "reason": "元の詩と食事のもじりを対にした表現。普通の散文ではないが意味を欠く扱いにはせず、後略という明示的省略を記録。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "original_text_sha256": "70f340d3b71f3a7408c6bbef1e2798cac3176e734c83cee89b426798e7b7356a",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:2bdeb26f-c73f-497e-bc51-f933bdbe82d7>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40760,
      "native_body_tokens": 394,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 1291,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 0,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "multiple_answer_speakers"
      ],
      "reason": "下北沢の出演者を求める質問に演奏者・朗読者など複数の回答が対応する。話者表示は薄いが無関係な推薦リストではなく、最後の経験談も終わる。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "original_text_sha256": "2605230da4e0094489513b5340692f42cff44391894c17386d7d91375969e7ce",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:93ab5ea5-1f5a-4fb1-b109-d796b26f4a63>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40833,
      "native_body_tokens": 2520,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 9363,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "source_credit",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "political_essay",
        "source_credit_tail"
      ],
      "reason": "引用を用いた政治思想への批評で、節ごとの論旨と結びがある。最後は掲載誌と日付。立場や主張の正しさは採点していない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "original_text_sha256": "4fa485b118a9a4c5b0cd9bcdeda32e2ed57029ddcc323cb31a097f39101dfe44",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:937548af-bef4-4ef0-9ac9-f0e8afe57b7e>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40938,
      "native_body_tokens": 1936,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 6593,
      "grammar": 1,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "bibliographic_credit",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "ruby_linebreak_damage",
        "literary_text"
      ],
      "reason": "食事中の人物と猿の対比を描く話と解説はつながる。ルビ除去に由来する語中改行や字形注記が多く、末尾は底本・入力・校正・修正の情報。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "original_text_sha256": "addc7635a9749fcab6f887f04bbf14e8b97284b06b94e116756276a835e0e2d2",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:80001cfc-82d4-4888-b277-d1bb4805c8d4>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40856,
      "native_body_tokens": 2375,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 7610,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 0,
      "ending_type": "explicit_close",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "unverified_causal_claims",
        "religious_argument"
      ],
      "reason": "聖書引用と歴史・災害を結ぶ同じ主張が続き、おしまいで終わる。災害との因果や引用の正確さは未検証で、文法の良さを事実性の保証にしない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "original_text_sha256": "b7fefd4d6a08867012a8661c0b9b888e07ba7958b06a59904fb6eff6b70afdb4",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:29af96d9-4066-476c-b446-aa461adc7bc2>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40534,
      "native_body_tokens": 4274,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 17590,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "reference_list",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "science_essay",
        "references"
      ],
      "reason": "単位・測定方法・判断基準を例と節で説明し結びと次回案内がある。末尾は参考文献。医学・放射線安全基準の正確性を調査する評価ではない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "original_text_sha256": "e2b2e8acb02e33ea3c49543d9a2dbb53e717062027f79cbdf00a51fcf2beee15",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:828f9396-5996-428d-9ce1-7373ac084c67>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40351,
      "native_body_tokens": 3120,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 12635,
      "grammar": 1,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "category_metadata",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "machine_translation",
        "interview_and_commentary"
      ],
      "reason": "女優のインタビューとファンの感想は同じ対象に沿うが、翻訳部分に不自然な語順・誤語が多数ある。最後はカテゴリ欄。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "original_text_sha256": "43c0a50bec9bcbef552267bcd32b56668b3483ced6403ada799ff90c5de1e9a7",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:69ebe593-8610-4c51-afa3-8b80da88b26c>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40474,
      "native_body_tokens": 150,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 572,
      "grammar": 1,
      "coherence": 0,
      "boilerplate": 2,
      "ending_type": "UI_notification",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "mixed_abstract_fragments",
        "truncated"
      ],
      "reason": "別の疾患・治療・研究目的の断片がつながりなく並び、途中で切れたあとに引用保存・ログイン通知が続く。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "original_text_sha256": "2e78c0ce7481dde99acaf2ff949d1c6bd8b52adf804c63e61169143334245b73",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:9fccc9ba-9b6f-42d3-9c21-5a898b3c1be9>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40033,
      "native_body_tokens": 411,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 1432,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 0,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "diary"
      ],
      "reason": "陳情の受領、背景への考慮、承認から年末の所感へ進む短い記事で、語りと結びが自然。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "original_text_sha256": "9265136b33fb75ac39360fddb25aaddffa4a945465ff546cd6941400a2c46398",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:9ee86046-5f40-4e30-96e3-616e103481d5>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40273,
      "native_body_tokens": 219,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 780,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 0,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "diary",
        "colloquial_ending"
      ],
      "reason": "雨宿りから帰宅・夕食・読書までの一日の順序が通る。箇条書き風やたり終わりは日記の文体で、切断の証拠とはしない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "original_text_sha256": "f9f895de1157c31f7d5e2edaa22abaaa9fc3897a15055587d016225c34fa36a9",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:baa50445-bad4-4162-b97e-61edbeb4d999>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 40778,
      "native_body_tokens": 244,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 879,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "news",
        "timestamp_prefix"
      ],
      "reason": "捜索の現状、翌日の方針、流木回収の報告がつながる。更新時刻以外は短い完結ニュース本文。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "original_text_sha256": "e40ade856f9a0eb171c37ec49624372a11a7e1c8fc2ed2c9001f4bbd151c70ab",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:dbe64704-ef61-48e6-8034-18ab6c07aaf2>",
