      "source_row": 48458,
      "native_body_tokens": 877,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 3186,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "byline",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "news_credit"
      ],
      "reason": "制度変更の背景・組織の使命・関係者発言が通る記事で、最後は日付と編集部表示。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "original_text_sha256": "0609e87fc2d77a8a84bd15376808f44a96957d0618da66d99de81a16062bd64f",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:2b1cc203-05a4-4752-b0f5-2ab79729a65d>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 48953,
      "native_body_tokens": 441,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 1642,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 0,
      "boilerplate": 2,
      "ending_type": "UI_notification",
      "natural_prose_body_last": false,
      "flags": [
        "unrelated_recommendations",
        "mixed_questions",
        "navigation"
      ],
      "reason": "冒頭の英文の質問回答に、多数の別質問・受験記事・分野選択通知が接続する。全体を一つの筋の通った本文として扱えない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "original_text_sha256": "6a90c5f76cc0500a875910daedb2e04a886d956e1c6f2af2777f564b88b0f530",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:476dfdb3-8c05-4e9d-95c7-c632377d5b45>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 48539,
      "native_body_tokens": 156,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 521,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "review",
        "score_metadata"
      ],
      "reason": "評点属性に続くアニメの批評はテーマが一定で、最後の情報提示への不満も完結する。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "original_text_sha256": "0e2c3b752e598eb8483e2bbf274dc0cd5b76ca960a1c2ed28b406c398c538b44",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:ca095e82-675c-42b1-9602-5d15a3ffa0af>",
      "source_file": "jpn_Jpan/000_00000.parquet",
      "source_row": 48567,
      "native_body_tokens": 10681,
      "body_UTF8_bytes": 37653,
      "grammar": 2,
      "coherence": 2,
      "boilerplate": 1,
      "ending_type": "sentence",
      "natural_prose_body_last": true,
      "flags": [
        "multiple_articles",
        "duplicated_headings",
        "unverified_allegations"
      ],
      "reason": "複数の日付の記事・準備書面引用をまとめた長いページ。訴訟の同じ主張に沿い個々の節は通るが、一つの短い自然記事とは異なり同じ見出しと主張が繰り返される。掲載された人物への主張や法的評価は事実認定していない。",
      "full_original_body_read": true
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "original_text_sha256": "7270269161ef151cf05f5d52a160619ce2dc89b304164ab3b89ece765cae7466",
      "source_id": "<urn:uuid:ce375f29-cbff-4394-a6af-737c7ec81d62>",
